# i3 config file (v4)
#
# That first line is not decoration. Without it i3 reads this as a v3 config and
# runs it through i3-migrate-config-to-v4, which appends a default `bar` block —
# so a config whose entire point is "no bar" silently gets i3bar, and 24px of
# workspace height with it.
#
# Minimal i3 for the e2e desktop.
#
# No bar block: tauler is the bar. No keybindings: nothing types in here.
# Gaps are not set here either — tauler-i3 writes them at runtime via
# `gaps ... current set`, which is the behaviour under test.

font pango:JetBrains Mono 10

default_border pixel 2
new_window pixel 2

client.focused          #89b4fa #89b4fa #1e1e2e #89b4fa #89b4fa
client.unfocused        #45475a #313244 #cdd6f4 #45475a #45475a
client.focused_inactive #45475a #313244 #cdd6f4 #45475a #45475a
